{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Trip planner by AI 是一款以人工智能輔助旅遊規劃的 App，適合自助旅行者、自由行旅客，以及需要整理活動清單與筆記的人士。原價 US $0.99，現在<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，讓使用者以零成本體驗智能行程安排。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-255.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能建議活動並整理筆記</h2>\n<p>Trip planner by AI 結合人工智能協助規劃旅程，能就活動提供建議，讓使用者參考並安排假期行程。使用者可在獲得建議後建立個人計劃，把活動整理成清單，並加入自己的筆記，方便記錄想法與行程細節。無論是整理旅遊靈感還是編排每日活動，都可透過此工具集中處理。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-97-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-98-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-99-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-100-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-101-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Trip planner by AI</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/trip-planner-by-ai/id6743822045?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T19:04:15.881096+00:00","quality":